OL,3,GNEWSAProposed home to school transport 
OL,4,Acuts move forward                      
OL,6,FPlans which could see young people with
OL,7,Fdisabilities encouraged to use public  
OL,8,Fbuses to get to school have moved      
OL,9,Fforward as councillors agreed to a     
OL,10,Fconsultation on cost cutting measures. 
OL,12,FDurham County Council's cabinet        
OL,13,Fapproved a public consultation on      
OL,14,Fproposed changes to post-16 home to    
OL,15,Fschool transport at a meeting on       
OL,16,FWednesday.                             
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
