OL,3,GNEWSAProposed home to school transport 
OL,4,Acuts move forward                      
OL,6,FAn assessment made by the Reform UK-led
OL,7,Fauthority warned the proposals could   
OL,8,Fhave a "potential disproportionate     
OL,9,Fnegative impact" on disabled young     
OL,10,Fpeople, with more than 500 registered  
OL,11,Ffor post-16 home to school transport   
OL,12,Flast year.                             
OL,14,FThe consultation is expected to run    
OL,15,Ffrom January to March 2027.            
